    <entry>
        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Technical review: Document CSS custom functions]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40703</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40703"/>
        <updated>2025-08-19T15:17:14.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>
<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/#defining-custom-functions" rel="nofollow">CSS custom functions</a> have <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5179721933651968" rel="nofollow">landed in Chrome 139</a>.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR documents all of the associated sub-features that make up this feature. Specifically, it adds pages for:</p>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">@function</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">type()</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">&lt;dashed-function&gt;</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">CSSFunctionRule</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">CSSFunctionDeclarations</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> <code class="notranslate">CSSFunctionDescriptors</code></li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Module landing page for the "CSS Custom Functions and Mixins" module</li>
